      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "？　勘違い……？\nクリスマスはソリを引きながらチョコをばら撒き、\nお年玉をかけて雪合戦する――と聞いたんだが……？",
      "jp_sha256": "7ea350895d7e7af5246c9538214ec9aa764ce29fd16ac08dabdf28b7c07b8f98",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "? 착각……?\n크리스마스는 썰매를 끌며 초콜릿을 뿌리고,\n세뱃돈을 걸고 눈싸움하는 날이라고 들었는데……?",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 31,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b005-20261106-resume-same-model-pass2-r1",
